Z||000012||Haze_Performance||11-24-2001||05:32 PM||||I pulled EVERY piece of my interior out for this.. (EVERY piece).. I'm using "Performance Choice" by Mid America Corvette. <A HREF="http://www.madvet.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.madvet.com/</A>  <P>Step #1 Clean part's with soap & water. Make sure you dry it off. <P>Step #2 Spray on "Vinyl Prep" (for vinyl) or "Plastic Prep" (for plastic) to remove any hard to remove wax or silicone<P>Step #3 Spray on "Flexible Bonding Clear"<P>Step #4 Spray on "Color Top Coat" (Black)<P>Step #5 Finish up with "Color Coat Clear"<P><BR>I went with this stuff because I figured, If its good enough to restore a Classic Vette, Its good enough for my little Fiero.  <P>I'm not finished yet.. But heres some pics.. (All the black was re-dyed. even the stuff that was already black. I wanted to make sure that it all matched.)<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/014_12.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/023_21.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/022_20.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/025_23.JPG"> <P><BR>I get NO glare from the dash on sunny days. The dye job looks like its stock..<P>Good Luck & if you have any question... fire away..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>-Haze<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlife.gif">    <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="purple">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||10
Z||000013||Haze_Performance||11-24-2001||05:44 PM||||More pics....<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/012_12_3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/016_16_1_1.jpg"> <P>Visor cloth (Old vs. New)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/018_18_1_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/020_20_1_1.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlife.gif">    <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="purple">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||14
