Z||000018||Haze_Performance||11-24-2001||10:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 85ZainoGT:<BR><B>  HAZE -- how much did it cost you to buy all that stuff?  just so I can budget it in my next paycheck or two   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>It was arount $120.00 for everything. <P>4 cans of black<BR>3 cans of clear<BR>1 can vinyl prep<BR>1 can of plastic prep<BR>1 can of flex bonding stuff<P>Good luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>-Haze  <BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlife.gif">    <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="purple">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||14
